~ tutorial_glitch

Player: Ugh, why is it empty behind here? Hello?
Player: This is not normal... How do I get out of here?
[color=#ffde66] Press M to open map and seek what is happening.[/color]

=> END

~ map_explanation

[color=#ffff00]You are now seeing the map of your house.[/color]
[color=#ffff00]To move between rooms, you must place hallways.[/color]
[color=#ffff00]You can place hallways by selecting the hallway on bottom left or pressing 1 and 2.[/color]
[color=#ffff00]To cancel placement press Esc.[/color]
[color=#ffff00]To rotate your placement press Q or E.[/color]
[color=#ffff00]To place down, just use your left click.[/color]
[color=#ffff00]The amount of hallways you can place will be reduced. Both types share the same value. Be smart and economic about this![/color]
[color=#3399ff]Now, go to the central room of 2nd floor.[/color]

=> END 

~ map_reclaim_opening
You: That child...
You: ...How do I get there?...
You: I have no more hallways available...
[color=#ffff00]Open your map again.[/color]

=> END
~ map_reclaim_explanation
[color=#ffff00]You need more hallways to get into that room.[/color]
[color=#ffff00]Click on one of the hallways that you already placed.[/color]
[color=#ffff00]Click the Trash Icon to reclaim the hallway.[/color]
[color=#ffff00]Now the amount of hallway increased. You can place more hallways again.[/color]
[color=#ffff00]Reclaim the other hallways to get more amount again. [/color]
[color=#3399ff]Now, find that child. [/color]

=> END
